### List items with available stock
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/items

### Back office: set units on hand (cannot go below what open orders reserve)
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8080/items/sandwich/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{"onHand": 10}

### Open an order (basket)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{}

> {% client.global.set("order", response.body.id); %}

### Add an item: checks and reserves stock
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/orders/{{order}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"itemId": "coffee", "quantity": 2}

### Remove an item: releases its reservation
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8080/orders/{{order}}/items/coffee

### Get the order
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/orders/{{order}}

### Checkout: deducts reserved stock and sets submittedAt
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/orders/{{order}}/checkout
